flowchart TD
 A[Booking is Active] --> R[Rule-based risk review]
 R --> S[Coordinator reviews flag and reasons]
 S --> T[Risk score is advisory; no release action]

 A --> B{T−3h check-in opens}
 B --> C{Already KEEP or CANCEL?}
 C -- Yes --> D[No reminder; retain resolved status]
 C -- No --> E[App sends one automatic simulated reminder]
 E --> F{Employee response before T−2h?}
 F -- KEEP --> G[Confirm booking; retain space]
 F -- CANCEL --> H[Release space immediately]
 F -- RESCHEDULE --> I[Coordinator approval queue; original booking retained]
 F -- No response --> J[T−2h deadline reached]
 J --> K[Auto-release booking]
 K --> L[Notify Coordinator and booker]
 L --> M[Update availability for same space/date/time]
 M --> N[Slot can be booked by another employee]

 I --> O[Coordinator reviews request]
 O --> P[Pending-at-deadline policy requires explicit decision]
